# SDF shadows

## Ray-marched shadows are straightforward: march a ray

## towards each light source, don’t illuminate if the SDF ever drops

## too close to zero. Unlike ray-tracing, soft shadows are

## almost free with SDFs: attenuate illumination by a linear function of

## the ray marching near to another object.

* * *

Soft SDF shadows
